          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazi araterana, arengera imikogote n’abagendera ku mafarasi, hamwe n’ingabo za Farawo zose zari zakurikiye Abisirayeli mu kiyaga. Nta n’umwe muri bo yarokotse.",
          "type": "text",
